  "expertText": "; Fast clear screen routine\n* = $1000\n.const screen_ram = $0400\n\n.region Main\n.invoke SetColor(#$2)\n.invoke ClearScreen\n.invoke GoHome\n    RTS\n\n.endregion\n\nchar:\n.byte $20\n\n.macro ClearScreen\n    LDA char\n    LDX #$00\n.region Loop\n.loop X, $FF, clear\n    STA screen_ram,X\n    STA screen_ram+$0100,X\n    STA screen_ram+$0200,X\n    STA screen_ram+$0300,X\n.next clear\n.endregion\n\n.endm\n\n.macro GoHome\n    LDX #0\n; oszlop\n    LDY #0\n; sor\n    CLC\n; 0 = set cursor\n    JSR $FFF0\n; KERNAL PLOT\n    RTS\n.endm\n\n.macro SetColor(color)\n    LDA {color}\n    STA 53280\n    STA 53281\n.endm",
